Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=52}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.58,0:01:40.66,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,Watch where you're stepping!\NYou could have killed us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:43.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Oops! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:47.80,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:51.59,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Bonney's not the only one\Nwho's had a growth spurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.59,0:01:54.30,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,You won't lay a finger on Old Man Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:57.43,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Listen, kid, some of us have jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:02:01.14,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Let me go back to doing mine, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.35,0:02:04.77,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Let you go? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:19.83,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Whee! Whoa-whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:26.00,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.92,0:02:35.55,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Is this really necessary?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.89,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Whoa, take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:54.45,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Look at him flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:00.16,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,We have to run now! Let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:03.62,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're right. Let's go!\NWhile Luffy keeps Kizaru busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.62,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,Okay, but we have to be gentle with Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:11.05,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,Hey Atlas! You need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:14.51,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,I'm going down below.\NI have to take control of the Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:16.18,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.22,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,as soon as the barrier goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:25.14,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,your lasers will blow us to smithereens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:26.94,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,That's good thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.94,0:03:29.73,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,{\q2}Us Vegapunks are the highest authority on the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:33.59,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,after all. And whoever controls\Nthe Pacifistas, wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.03,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah! We got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:37.74,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Atlas, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:40.74,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I mean to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.99,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,please take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:43.62,Main-207+,Group,0,0,0,,– What?!\N– What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.21,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,You cannot go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:47.04,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:51.54,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.09,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I know, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:54.67,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Come in, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:56.80,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Vegapunk, can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:03:57.63,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:03:59.80,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}I just saw Bonney down in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:02.18,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,She's alive then?! What a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.06,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,She hit the barrier! Kizaru kicked her hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:06.81,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Kizaru did {\i1}what{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.81,0:04:10.23,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,And you just stood there and watched?!\NYou are a good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:11.69,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.69,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,I'll go save her right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:14.65,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'd better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:16.78,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are we gonna do about the barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.53,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind. I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:21.12,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.87,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,We'll have Edison deactivate the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:29.21,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, It's Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:32.71,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,I heard what you said! All of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.80,0:04:39.63,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,You're gonna go in and rescue her, right?\NThen you can count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:44.35,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,{\q2}Our work here is done. We picked up the luggage\Nyou asked us to, and we're on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.85,0:04:47.18,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll head toward the rear exit immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.98,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's all meet up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:51.65,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Go go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:52.56,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.11,0:04:55.23,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Did something just move?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.23,0:04:56.94,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:58.69,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,It's this way! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:04:59.57,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.78,0:05:05.66,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,I guess it's dangerous here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.05,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Come get some!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:30.08,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,What was that scream?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:32.27,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.27,0:05:33.60,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:37.41,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.50,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:53.33,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,{\i1}Report! What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:55.38,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Wait, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:18.40,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,D-Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.07,0:06:21.61,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.57,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,We've all been turned\Ninto children or old people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.82,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.83,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Everyone evade the center\Nof town! It's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:33.38,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,All central units were ambushed\Nby Jewelry Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.63,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Search the surrounding zones cautiously!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:38.00,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,She has the power to change your age!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:42.42,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,She couldn't have gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:46.09,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Find Jewelry Bonney and take her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:49.22,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:50.68,Secondary-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.60,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,I found Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:55.39,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,But he.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:58.81,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,looks like he's been burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:01.11,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:15.62,Flashbacks-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Sentomaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:17.50,Flashbacks-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.09,Flashbacks-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,Bonney.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:22.49,Flashbacks-207+,Sentomaru,0,0,0,,The Marines... are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:29.10,Flashbacks-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Sentomaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:32.22,Thoughts-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:32.97,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Have you found her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:33.77,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Not yet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:34.68,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Check that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:35.56,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.94,Thoughts-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,I wonder if I can hide till this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:48.95,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.95,0:07:50.83,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,Just fight me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.91,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,You have nothing to gain from this, Roronoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:58.12,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Stay out of our way and let us do our job!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:11.10,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:14.02,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter how fast you run,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:17.19,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,I know right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.40,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,Cause you stink like a beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:07.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Whoa, was that pigeon guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.07,0:09:10.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Zoro, want my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:15.53,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:24.25,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,Just focus on Kizaru! He's the real problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.61,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,You're barely keeping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:52.57,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,If this is the best you can do, you're never\Ngonna get another shot at our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:56.08,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,But I've still got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:58.45,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,An emperor's first mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:00.54,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,That's a worthy trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:20.77,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,I might drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:23.35,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,That won't do at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:35.22,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yasakani Sacred Jewel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:49.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:24.58,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Ouch! My face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:40.55,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I've seen these!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:57.49,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Again with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:22.81,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Well, it's fine. A bigger target is easier to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.81,0:12:24.27,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,So thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I don't know which one is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:58.22,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:00.01,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I'll hit them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.89,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:28.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:39.59,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I thought {\i1}I{\i0} was the one tricking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:42.30,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Now, this is unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:45.93,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,I leave for one second and Vegapunk is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:48.27,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Could you tell me where he is, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.98,Main-207+,Usopp,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, I could use a little help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:10.41,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey, Vegapunk! Let me in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:12.83,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,You're really worked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:14.25,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Not that I blame you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:17.13,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Don't you touch her,\Nyou bootlicking Navy scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:20.76,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Never fear, Bonney!\NI'm on my way! Stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:24.39,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I should have protected you!\NYou poor darling child!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.39,0:14:25.97,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Poor darling child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:27.85,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Get in already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:31.02,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,I'll let you in the bubble!\NJust shove yourself through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:33.19,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Well, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:44.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! Stay in the dome thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:46.99,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,You're gonna get killed out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:52.00,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd just let you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.21,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,This is over, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.21,0:14:58.71,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Do something, Stella! He's going to kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:20.73,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,Back already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:23.44,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,Whoa, Stella!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:24.70,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Change of plans!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:27.49,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,We'll use General Franky to carry the Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.08,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm catching a ride with these bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.58,Main-207+,Lilith,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:00.90,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Edison! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:02.40,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.86,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,Frontier Dome,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.74,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,partially deactivate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.53,Main-207+,Edison,0,0,0,,Reactivate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:15.52,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Can this thing fly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:27.42,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Wait. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:29.89,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Something's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:32.70,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Hold on! I think I can see inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.85,0:16:34.81,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,It's Dr. Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:39.10,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,I have a report from the Fabriophase!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:40.40,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,It's urgent!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:44.65,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,We've just spotted Vegapunk! He's descending\Nfrom the Labophase in a vehicle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:47.03,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Take aim! Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.12,0:16:57.87,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.46,0:17:02.46,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,You have a new order, direct\Nfrom Dr. Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:04.75,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Every Marine on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:10.80,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,must be eliminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:39.75,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.75,0:17:41.42,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,I think it's time to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:44.33,Main-207+,Pacfista,0,0,0,,New target designated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:47.80,Main-207+,Pacfista,0,0,0,,Destroy all Marines on Egghead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:55.47,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Get away from the Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:08.87,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,They have a new order!\NDr. Vegapunk must have taken control back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.45,0:18:15.25,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,So many Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.25,0:18:17.12,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to fight them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.83,0:18:20.58,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Damn you, Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:24.25,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Yeah! Now it's a party!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:28.63,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Let it rip, Pacifistas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:31.63,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Seems they're all responding to the command!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:32.55,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:36.51,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:40.02,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,It looks like we're going straight down!\NWe're not gonna dive bomb
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.60,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,into the ground, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:45.85,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,We are on Island Clouds.\NIt's in their nature to attach to one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.85,0:18:51.40,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,{\q2}Since our tires are also made of clouds,\Nwe won't fall to our deaths, even if we head straight down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:54.86,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But enough about our ride.\NWe must find Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.86,0:18:57.87,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,She's surely alone and terrified down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.49,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Hey, Bonney, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.49,0:19:02.37,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:03.79,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Hey, Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:06.29,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:15.26,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,I need to focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:17.76,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Don't think! Feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.23,0:19:20.81,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,I'll reach out across the entire universe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:24.20,Thoughts-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,and sense her with the waves of my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.49,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,My Lady-dar got a ping!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:37.70,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,I found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.70,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Where is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.70,0:19:41.70,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,All I can see are Marines everywhere I look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.20,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Same for me. Are you sure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.96,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Don't question me,\Nmy Lady-dar's never wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:48.83,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:53.34,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I dispute the science of your methods,\Nbut I will trust your instinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.72,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Thanks, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:57.05,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll all excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:20:00.51,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,this tank just can't keep up\Nwith my impatient heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.97,0:20:06.52,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Bonney! I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:09.98,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.61,0:20:12.86,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Looks like the Pacifistas are back on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.83,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,Thought you could hide, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:28.92,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,This is over, Jewelry Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:31.29,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,You'll pay for what you did to our men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.30,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,Over there! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.29,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with you three?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:17.38,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,I think I just went to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:21.47,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,Get back here, I'm not done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:26.97,Main-207+,Pacfista,0,0,0,,You cannot escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:32.69,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.11,0:21:38.57,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Ha. I can't command all the Pacifistas,\Nbut I snuck around the rules for this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:42.70,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,I have the power to control anything I sit on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:45.53,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Cause I'm a Driving Human\Nwho ate the Ride-Ride Fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.53,0:21:51.81,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Now, here's a little question. Will that curse\Nyou placed on our men be lifted if I kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:21:58.51,Thoughts-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:22:00.85,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Last chance, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:03.59,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Change them back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:14.23,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Come on, Bonney, don't zone out on us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:17.82,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,Black Leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.57,0:22:21.53,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Look, I get it.\NIt's because Kuma's your father, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:28.54,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,You have to remember\Nthey're not him! If you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:33.75,Main-207+,Pomsky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Otter Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:38.30,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Marines everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:42.26,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Time for us to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.26,0:22:45.76,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Go, Pacifista! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:48.93,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Ah, Smith!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.19,0:23:02.53,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Get in the Bubble! Let's roll! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:07.62,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,The Pacifistas will fire on us!\NLet's head back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:09.74,Main-207+,Bluegrass,0,0,0,,Oh, just shake it off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.97,0:24:07.09,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,It's no use resisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.09,0:24:09.89,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,Your fate is already sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.93,0:24:12.01,Thoughts-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,This guy never learns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.03,0:24:37.29,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know why you're doing this,\Nbut I've got orders to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.50,0:24:42.46,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.89,0:24:56.73,Main-207+,Lucci,0,0,0,,The clock is ticking! Struggle while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.39,0:25:02.02,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,Sure like to talk, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.57,0:25:19.21,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you'll excuse me, I have a mission to wrap up\Nand you are wasting too much of my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.29,0:25:25.84,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,That's the idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.01,0:25:29.63,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}my{\i0} mission to get in your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.03,0:25:54.37,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.26,0:26:13.76,Main-207+,Nami,0,0,0,,Why did you stop? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.26,0:26:15.64,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:17.60,Main-207+,Chopper,0,0,0,,Something doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.60,0:26:21.06,Main-207+,Jinbe,0,0,0,,What is this? Such an unnatural presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:40.62,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.66,0:26:44.96,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,All units, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.80,0:26:54.97,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The Pacifistas aren't
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.97,0:26:58.01,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,protecting us anymore!\NThey're not even moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.01,0:26:59.76,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Come on! I gave you an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:01.72,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,Eliminate all the Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:04.14,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,You're supposed to keep us safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.89,0:27:06.90,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Something's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.98,0:27:12.32,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,There's only one above Vegapunk\Non the authority ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.74,0:27:13.95,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,and that's.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.86,0:27:16.74,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,the Five Elders!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.12,0:27:22.58,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:34.38,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,It's a pentagram!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.27,0:27:46.44,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.44,0:27:48.94,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Step on it! Get to high ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.94,0:27:49.65,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,I'll try!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.53,0:27:55.24,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,Attention all Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.61,0:28:00.70,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,St. Saturn is on his way!\NHe will arrive on Egghead shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:05.41,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Not a single Marine below the rank\Nof Commodore may be in his presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.66,0:28:07.87,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,He's coming here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.87,0:28:09.33,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,{\i1}I repeat, St.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.33,0:28:13.92,Main-207+,Doberman,0,0,0,,{\i1}Saturn and the Five Elders\Nwill make landfall on Egghead!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.72,0:28:24.14,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.72,0:28:28.48,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,One of the Five Elders.\NSo I'm shocked that they came in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.48,0:28:29.85,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,The Five Elders?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.85,0:28:31.52,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Never heard of them! Who are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.52,0:28:33.57,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,The highest authorities in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.57,0:28:35.91,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Wait! For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.84,0:28:59.22,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Something big's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.62,0:29:26.87,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,What the hell {\i1}is{\i0} that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.87,0:29:28.37,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,It's some kind of monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.37,0:29:29.29,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.62,0:29:31.21,Main-207+,Marine,0,0,0,,That must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.01,0:29:42.96,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,Ah. The surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.34,0:29:45.94,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.14,0:29:52.35,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,That's huge! What is that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.52,0:29:55.52,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.52,0:29:56.48,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.15,0:30:02.36,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.36,0:30:04.57,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.57,0:30:07.85,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,We don't have any clouds to grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.50,0:30:10.91,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.17,0:30:17.88,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I found you! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.42,0:30:22.80,Main-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,Boy, you gotta be running out of juice.\NThat form won't hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.80,0:30:24.80,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,Do something, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.80,0:30:28.81,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,We're literally gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.52,0:30:36.36,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.97,0:31:10.06,Thoughts-207+,Kizaru,0,0,0,,No, I don't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.77,0:31:17.23,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,Nika.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.25,0:31:43.59,Main-207+,Franky,0,0,0,,You okay, Doc? Still breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.59,0:31:45.59,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,So it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.59,0:31:47.59,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Atlas, are you hurt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.59,0:31:48.55,Main-207+,Atlas,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.60,0:31:57.31,Main-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,Are you St. Saturn?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.31,0:31:58.86,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.32,0:32:07.11,Main-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,I thought you were already dead,\NVegapunk. What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.12,0:32:16.58,Flashbacks-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,I gave you an order, Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.09,0:32:27.13,Main-207+,Sanji,0,0,0,,Bonney, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.09,0:32:34.06,Flashbacks-207+,Saturn,0,0,0,,You must eliminate Kuma's free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.73,0:32:39.90,Flashbacks-207+,Vegapunk,0,0,0,,But if I do that to him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.87,0:32:59.83,Main-207+,Bonney,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=53}===============================DIALOGUE============================
